properties.description:
The acceptance check for slice 3, six cases:
- what lands is proposed with its origin, and the inbox is reported;
- it binds only on the part owner's acceptance and cannot be rewritten after;
- a move hands the requirement over and copies nothing;
- a move is refused while satisfied here or without the owner's word;
- piece and derived are linked across, and the parent lists what it sent;
- a ripple in the parent carries down seeded at what the part received.
